# GitHub language stats (linguist) only; no effect on git itself.
# Third-party model code and SDK headers, kept in the repo for the ONNX export and the build:
engine/GMFSS_Fortuna/** linguist-vendored
engine/rife/** linguist-vendored
engine/live/build_src/nvofa/** linguist-vendored
# Our headers are C++ (linguist reads a bare .h as C):
*.h linguist-language=C++

# The double-click launcher keeps its CRLF line ends in every checkout and in GitHub's "Download ZIP" (cmd.exe can
# miss a label in a batch file with bare LF line ends), so git stores its bytes as they are:
/SmoothMyVideo.cmd -text
